# NEXTRACK — this repo documents and organizes music. It never stores audio.
# The audio you download from Beatport / Tidal lives on your drive, in folders
# that MIRROR this structure, but is git-ignored to keep the repo legal & light.

# --- Audio files (never commit copyrighted downloads) ---
*.mp3
*.wav
*.flac
*.aiff
*.aif
*.m4a
*.aac
*.ogg
*.wma
*.alac

# --- Video / lightshow renders ---
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi

# --- DJ software exports / caches (rekordbox, Serato, Traktor, engine) ---
*.pls
*.m3u8
/PIONEER/
/Serato/
/Contents/
*.anlz
*.DAT

# --- Local audio drop folders (mirror the repo layout on disk) ---
/audio/
/downloads/
/library/

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
